---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import aboutImage from "../assets/studies/April+15,+2022+2+02.webp";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Brandon's Portfolio"
  description="Learn about Brandon's background, skills, and creative approach."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg">
          Brandon is a digital illustrator based in Southern California. With over 
          5 years of industry experience working on TV productions, he emphasizes
          high independence, fast turnover, and the ability to clearly capture
          director vision.  
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg">
          Brandon has worked in a variety of styles, from comic book to expressionism. 
          He has painted backgrounds, characters, props, and worked throughout the full
          production pipeline. Beyond industry work, he is frequently painting for his
          personal satisfaction and skill development on his
        <a
          href="https://instagram.com/civilizedyapper/"
          target="_blank"
        >
        Instagram.
        </a>
        </p>

